\\\",\\n      \\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u1\\\",\\\"u13\\\",\\\"u14\\\",\\\"u29\\\"],\\n      \\\"status\\\":\\\"AMBIGUOUS\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"dimension\\\":\\\"definitions\\\",\\n      \\\"explanation\\\":\\\"Gift and discount are not fully defined. Additional returns may be gifts, rather than automatically being gifts. Product type expressly includes certain types of funds and funds offered by certain fund houses. The degree of linkage remains unresolved.\\\",\\n      \\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u8\\\",\\\"u13\\\",\\\"u14\\\"],\\n      \\\"status\\\":\\\"AMBIGUOUS\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"dimension\\\":\\\"exceptions\\\",\\n      \\\"explanation\\\":\\\"The fee-or-charge discount parenthesis qualifies gifts under the selected control, including its product-type application. It does not exempt the arrangement from section 103 or advertising requirements. The text does not settle whether a cash rebate or a discount on unrelated services qualifies.\\\",\\n      \\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u10\\\",\\\"u14\\\",\\\"u15\\\",\\\"u21\\\"],\\n      \\\"status\\\":\\\"AMBIGUOUS\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"dimension\\\":\\\"modality\\\",\\n      \\\"explanation\\\":\\\"'Should not offer' supplies the selected negative conduct standard; 'will be bound' applies it to linked gifts. 'May be considered a gift' leaves classification open. Neither proof of actual distraction nor statutory-offence status is required by this selected screen.\\\",\\n      \\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u13\\\",\\\"u14\\\",\\\"u15\\\",\\\"u24\\\"],\\n      \\\"status\\\":\\\"PROPOSED\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"dimension\\\":\\\"time\\\",\\n      \\\"explanation\\\":\\\"The control addresses offering gifts during promotion; the packet provides no commencement date, transition period or deadline. The date 2010-09-30 identifies the cited FAQ’s issuance only. Advertising guidance issued 'from time to time' does not supply the gift control’s effective date.\\\",\\n      \\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u14\\\",\\\"u24\\\",\\\"u30\\\",\\\"u31\\\"],\\n      \\\"status\\\":\\\"AMBIGUOUS\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"dimension\\\":\\\"dependencies\\\",\\n      \\\"explanation\\\":\\\"The underlying Code paragraph 3.11 and cited FAQ answer are not reproduced in full. The packet lists external-authorities.23ec46 without a source hash. Section 103, the Handbook, paragraph 2.3 and advertising guidance remain separate unresolved authorities; their requirements cannot be inferred from passing this screen.\\\",\\n      \\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u7\\\",\\\"u10\\\",\\\"u12\\\",\\\"u14\\\",\\\"u21\\\",\\\"u22\\\",\\\"u28\\\",\\\"u29\\\",\\\"u30\\\",\\\"u31\\\"],\\n      \\\"status\\\":\\\"AMBIGUOUS\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"questions\\\": [\\n    \\\"Does the cited FAQ answer treat campaign presentation alone as sufficient product linkage, or require a more direct promotional nexus?\\\",\\n    \\\"What does the complete paragraph 3.11 establish about actor applicability and the meanings of gift and discount, including cash rebates and unrelated-service discounts?\\\",\\n    \\\"What circular date and applicable versions of the Code and FAQ govern the offer being assessed?\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"readings\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"assumptions\\\": [\\n        \\\"The selected control is assessed for one identified benefit offer by a distributor to a client in the SFC-authorised-fund setting.\\\",\\n        \\\"A direct promotional nexus may arise from express promotion or eligibility terms; it need not require a completed investment.\\\",\\n        \\\"Gift and discount classifications are supplied judgments, not inferred merely from the label 'additional return'.\\\",\\n        \\\"The result means the offer is flagged by this selected gift-control reading; it is not a determination of legal liability or overall compliance.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"citations\\\": [\\n        {\\\"quote\\\":\\\"Intermediaries who distribute these funds (distributors)\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u1\\\"},\\n        {\\\"quote\\\":\\\"distributors should not offer any gifts (other than a discount of fees or charges) in promoting a specific investment product or a particular type of investment product to a client.\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u14\\\"},\\n        {\\\"quote\\\":\\\"If gifts are offered in such a way that they are linked to a particular type of investment product\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u14\\\"},\\n        {\\\"quote\\\":\\\"as they may be considered a gift that should not be offered to investors.\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u13\\\"}\\n      ],\\n      \\\"distinction\\\":\\\"Requires a direct promotional nexus. Consider an account-opening gift available regardless of investment choice, presented prominently alongside a campaign devoted to funds from one fund house, but with no express statement or eligibility term connecting the gift to those funds. If the presentation creates a contextual association but no direct nexus, this reading does not flag it; R2 does. Mere proximity without a meaningful association satisfies neither reading.\\\",\\n      \\\"family\\\":\\\"scope\\\",\\n      \\\"formalization\\\":{\\n        \\\"facts\\\":[\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The assessed offer is by an intermediary distributing SFC-authorised funds to a client in that distribution setting.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"distributor_client_setting\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u1\\\",\\\"u14\\\",\\\"u29\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"truth value\\\"},\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The assessed benefit is offered to the client and qualifies as a gift for the selected paragraph 3.11 control.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"gift_offered\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u13\\\",\\\"u14\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"truth value\\\"},\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The assessed benefit qualifies as a discount of fees or charges within the stated exception.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"fee_discount\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u14\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"truth value\\\"},\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The offer expressly promotes, or its eligibility terms directly connect it to, a specific investment product or a particular product type, including funds from a particular fund house.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"direct_product_nexus\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u14\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"truth value\\\"},\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The manner or campaign context of offering the gift meaningfully associates it with a specific investment product or particular product type, independently of an express promotion or eligibility connection.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"contextual_product_nexus\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u14\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"truth value\\\"}\\n        ],\\n        \\\"result\\\":\\\"(and gift_offered (not fee_discount) direct_product_nexus)\\\",\\n        \\\"result_type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\n        \\\"scope\\\":\\\"distributor_client_setting\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"local_id\\\":\\\"gift_direct_nexus\\\",\\n      \\\"questions\\\":[\\n        \\\"Does 'linked' require the direct nexus proposed here? The final sentence of u14 may instead deliberately reach indirect promotional associations.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"statement\\\":\\\"Read 'in promoting' as requiring a direct connection between the gift offer and promotion of a specified product or product type. The final sentence prevents avoidance through promotion of a fund category or fund house instead of a named fund, while retaining that direct connection. A qualifying fee discount remains excepted.\\\",\\n      \\\"subject\\\":\\\"Selected paragraph-10 gift-promotion control: direct product connection\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"assumptions\\\":[\\n        \\\"The selected control is assessed for one identified benefit offer by a distributor to a client in the SFC-authorised-fund setting.\\\",\\n        \\\"A meaningful product association created by the manner of offering can suffice without product-specific gift eligibility.\\\",\\n        \\\"Actual investor distraction is not a separate factual prerequisite; the stated purpose informs the linkage interpretation.\\\",\\n        \\\"Gift and discount classifications are supplied judgments. The result flags only this selected control.\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"citations\\\":[\\n        {\\\"quote\\\":\\\"The purpose of the requirement is to avoid the use of gifts to distract investors from the features and risks of a particular product.\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u14\\\"},\\n        {\\\"quote\\\":\\\"If gifts are offered in such a way that they are linked to a particular type of investment product, such as certain types of funds or funds offered by certain fund houses, then such gifts will be bound by this requirement\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u14\\\"},\\n        {\\\"quote\\\":\\\"other than a discount of fees or charges\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u14\\\"},\\n        {\\\"quote\\\":\\\"The answer to question 1 of the frequently asked questions on the Code of Conduct issued by the SFC on 30 September 2010.\\\",\\\"unit_id\\\":\\\"u30\\\"}\\n      ],\\n      \\\"distinction\\\":\\\"Reaches a meaningful association produced by campaign presentation as well as an express connection. In the account-opening-gift example in R1, contextual linkage to one fund house flags the non-discount gift even though eligibility is investment-neutral. This reading has stronger support in 'offered in such a way' and the distraction rationale, but the missing FAQ prevents settling how much contextual association suffices.\\\",\\n      \\\"family\\\":\\\"scope\\\",\\n      \\\"formalization\\\":{\\n        \\\"facts\\\":[\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The assessed offer is by an intermediary distributing SFC-authorised funds to a client in that distribution setting.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"distributor_client_setting\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u1\\\",\\\"u14\\\",\\\"u29\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"truth value\\\"},\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The assessed benefit is offered to the client and qualifies as a gift for the selected paragraph 3.11 control.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"gift_offered\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u13\\\",\\\"u14\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"truth value\\\"},\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The assessed benefit qualifies as a discount of fees or charges within the stated exception.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"fee_discount\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u14\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"truth value\\\"},\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The offer expressly promotes, or its eligibility terms directly connect it to, a specific investment product or a particular product type, including funds from a particular fund house.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"direct_product_nexus\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u14\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"truth value\\\"},\\n          {\\\"meaning\\\":\\\"The manner or campaign context of offering the gift meaningfully associates it with a specific investment product or particular product type, independently of an express promotion or eligibility connection.\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"contextual_product_nexus\\\",\\\"requires_judgment\\\":true,\\\"source_unit_ids\\\":[\\\"u14\\\"],\\\"type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\\"unit\\\":\\\"truth value\\\"}\\n        ],\\n        \\\"result\\\":\\\"(and gift_offered (not fee_discount) (or direct_product_nexus contextual_product_nexus))\\\",\\n        \\\"result_type\\\":\\\"bool\\\",\\n        \\\"scope\\\":\\\"distributor_client_setting\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"local_id\\\":\\\"gift_contextual_nexus\\\",\\n      \\\"questions\\\":[\\n        \\\"What distinguishes a meaningful contextual product association from incidental placement alongside fund advertising under the missing FAQ?\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"statement\\\":\\\"Read 'offered in such a way that they are linked' as extending the control to indirect but meaningful promotional associations created by presentation or campaign design. A non-discount gift linked in that manner to a product or fund-house category falls within the selected control even when its eligibility terms are product-neutral. The fee-discount exception continues to apply.\\\",\\n      \\\"subject\\\":\\\"Selected paragraph-10 gift-promotion control: contextual product connection\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\"}}\n{\"type\":\"turn.completed\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":28233,\"cached_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_write_input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":3258,\"reasoning_output_tokens\":70}}\n","fresh_context":true,"independence":"CONTEXT_ONLY_SAME_MODEL_CORRELATION_UNMEASURED","model":"gpt-6-astra","provider":"codex.fresh.v1","provider_route_hash":"3d676052ff208f9c0b35467659af41d3138476127d0d1b523970689c2edf4714","request_hash":"feb19dbe245310752b131863ff30dfe5fdbc83f0283ee7d244fba3707009b8aa","response_hash":"3c6ee3422fd56b1bbaf8f34b3e5562cfdea413b57c8a6e1d3ed173bbf85b3d3e","transport_retry_policy":"NO_APPLICATION_RETRY; CLI transport behavior is external","usage":[{"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"cached_input_tokens":0,"input_tokens":28233,"output_tokens":3258,"reasoning_output_tokens":70}],"wall_milliseconds":112477},"response":{"coverage":[{"reason":"Defines distributors and the circular’s SFC-authorised-fund context.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"u1"},{"reason":"Background heading.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"u2"},{"reason":"Describes additional features motivating the circular.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"u3"},{"reason":"Describes standing-instruction services; does not itself establish a gift.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"u4"},{"reason":